WEBVTT

01:32.107 --> 01:37.425
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.425 --> 01:40.760
[Episode 10]

01:40.760 --> 01:41.799
The purslane

01:42.319 --> 01:43.840
has value,

01:43.840 --> 01:46.040
but it's not nearly as good as the peony.

01:47.480 --> 01:49.599
Looks like we've lost some money
on the medicinal herbs,

01:49.599 --> 01:50.719
but in fact,

01:50.719 --> 01:52.680
it has bought us more time

01:52.680 --> 01:53.799
to profit sooner.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.640
I learned to do business

01:55.640 --> 01:56.920
with my father since I was little.

01:56.920 --> 01:58.879
The first thing I learned was

01:58.879 --> 02:00.040
sometimes,

02:00.040 --> 02:01.680
time is more valuable

02:01.680 --> 02:02.680
than money.

02:05.879 --> 02:07.159
I see.

02:11.199 --> 02:12.400
Shengyi.

02:12.400 --> 02:14.719
Since you had doubts,

02:14.719 --> 02:16.159
why didn't you ask me before?

02:17.759 --> 02:19.439
I don't understand the ways of doing business,

02:20.039 --> 02:21.080
for fear of saying something wrong

02:21.080 --> 02:22.360
and ruining your plan.

02:22.879 --> 02:24.639
I knew it now.

02:24.639 --> 02:27.000
As expected, I'm being shortsighted.

02:27.000 --> 02:28.120
From now on,

02:28.120 --> 02:29.520
I'll do whatever you say.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.520
I won't ask any question again.

02:30.520 --> 02:31.560
Don't say so.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.000
We are partners in business.

02:34.599 --> 02:36.199
We are equals.

02:36.199 --> 02:37.680
If you have any doubts,

02:37.680 --> 02:38.800
just ask me.

02:46.199 --> 02:47.639
Mudan,

02:47.639 --> 02:49.439
you can both read

02:49.439 --> 02:50.560
and do business.

02:51.199 --> 02:52.879
And you said once you've made money,

02:52.879 --> 02:54.719
then you'd buy back your mother's house.

02:55.319 --> 02:57.639
You must be from a wealthy family.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.719
Shengyi.

03:02.719 --> 03:05.719
If we no longer worry about money,

03:05.719 --> 03:07.176
what do you want to do?

03:15.199 --> 03:16.400
Before I got married,

03:17.159 --> 03:18.759
I lived for my parents and siblings.

03:20.439 --> 03:23.240
After I got married,
my husband was my everything.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.639
I've never thought

03:26.639 --> 03:27.719
what I want to do

03:28.280 --> 03:29.360
or what I can do.

03:34.039 --> 03:35.919
Now you are free.

03:35.919 --> 03:37.520
You can do whatever you want.

03:38.479 --> 03:39.719
Have you ever thought about

03:40.479 --> 03:41.919
learning to write?

03:41.919 --> 03:43.319
So, you can read account books

03:43.319 --> 03:45.439
and official documents.

03:45.439 --> 03:47.240
And you will no longer be fooled.

03:48.960 --> 03:49.960
I…

03:49.960 --> 03:53.319
It's too late to learn at this age.

03:57.800 --> 04:01.360
I'm afraid I would make mistakes
to keep accounts by myself.

04:01.960 --> 04:04.039
If I hire another accountant,

04:04.039 --> 04:05.479
it'll cost us a lot,

04:05.479 --> 04:06.639
and I'm worried of being cheated.

04:07.960 --> 04:09.199
Shengyi.

04:09.199 --> 04:10.319
The person I trust most now

04:10.319 --> 04:11.439
is only you.

04:11.439 --> 04:12.680
You are smart and diligent.

04:12.680 --> 04:14.240
Surely you will learn quickly.

04:14.240 --> 04:17.040
Just help me, okay?

04:17.959 --> 04:19.040
Help me.

04:19.800 --> 04:21.519
Then, I hope you

04:21.519 --> 04:23.319
would forgive me for being slow-witted.

04:24.920 --> 04:26.439
Come on, I'll teach you now.

04:31.879 --> 04:33.920
The Jiang Mansion is so lively.

04:36.480 --> 04:38.000
He's having party every night,

04:38.000 --> 04:39.079
not fearing it harmful to health.

04:39.920 --> 04:41.360
I just hope my Qiongtai Yulu

04:41.360 --> 04:42.759
would be placed in a safe spot,

04:42.759 --> 04:44.360
not being knocked or bumped by anyone.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.560
Shengyi.

04:51.560 --> 04:53.040
I'll teach you right now.

04:53.040 --> 04:54.839
Look, when we do the accounting,

04:54.839 --> 04:56.879
it has to be from right to left.

04:56.879 --> 04:58.040
You know about that, right?

05:03.528 --> 05:08.450
[Jiang Mansion]

05:15.800 --> 05:17.360
It must be foolproof.

05:17.360 --> 05:18.519
What I brought this time

05:18.519 --> 05:20.480
is twice as much as the last time.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.759
This time, we would surely succeed.

05:22.759 --> 05:24.879
The Floral Envoy is so unpredictable.

05:24.879 --> 05:26.280
Lady He.

05:29.240 --> 05:31.120
Is today Mr. Jiang's birthday?

05:31.120 --> 05:32.560
Why have so many people come?

05:33.680 --> 05:36.199
No. Today is the fifteenth of the month,
suitable for opening the warehouse.

05:37.360 --> 05:39.319
You would frequently move around here.

05:39.319 --> 05:40.319
I'll take you for a tour.

05:44.240 --> 05:45.360
The merchants

05:45.360 --> 05:47.040
would open the warehouses and move goods.

05:47.920 --> 05:50.160
What are the practices in the Jiang Mansion?

05:50.160 --> 05:51.519
My lord says

05:51.519 --> 05:52.920
since the warehouse door is opened,

05:52.920 --> 05:54.360
we must put something in.

05:55.000 --> 05:57.920
These officials all here
to help fill the warehouse.

05:57.920 --> 06:00.120
Next, please enter the main hall.

06:07.279 --> 06:08.480
My lord's little pet.

06:11.839 --> 06:13.160
Little pet?

06:27.560 --> 06:29.439
A pipa inlaid with gems and seashells.

06:31.079 --> 06:32.439
Such a large scale.

06:33.360 --> 06:35.120
This scale was custom-made by My lord.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.360
If the item doesn't pass this scale,

06:36.360 --> 06:38.040
it can't be presented to My lord.

06:41.319 --> 06:42.759
The gem on this

06:42.759 --> 06:44.199
is worth the annual salary

06:44.199 --> 06:45.800
of a Sixth-Rank official.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.519
Take it slow, slower.

06:49.519 --> 06:50.959
Hold steady.

06:50.959 --> 06:52.439
Come on, weigh it.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.439
Weigh it!

06:56.439 --> 06:57.864
Mr. Feng.

06:59.399 --> 07:01.319
We will not accept it.

07:02.000 --> 07:03.680
Why not?

07:03.680 --> 07:05.279
Didn't you say as long as the item

07:05.279 --> 07:07.920
weighs over a hundred taels,
then one can meet Mr. Jiang?

07:08.839 --> 07:10.759
Your stone is heavy enough,

07:11.279 --> 07:13.040
but your sincerity

07:13.040 --> 07:14.160
is not.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.360
This is red coral…

07:16.360 --> 07:18.160
With such a large rare stone,

07:18.160 --> 07:19.680
and yet his sincerity is still not enough.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.759
I specially had someone
bring it by sea from Qiongzhou.

07:21.759 --> 07:23.759
It took me a lot of trouble.

07:23.759 --> 07:27.240
My sincerity towards Mr. Jiang

07:27.240 --> 07:28.839
is just like this rare stone,

07:28.839 --> 07:30.639
large and bright red.

07:32.079 --> 07:33.720
Mr. Feng.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.160
I think it's because

07:35.160 --> 07:37.399
your sincerity toward others is not enough.

07:41.639 --> 07:42.879
Chuanyu.

07:42.879 --> 07:44.360
Thank you for your hard work.

07:44.360 --> 07:45.519
Why not

07:45.519 --> 07:47.160
do me a favor?

07:47.160 --> 07:49.600
Drink some tea and get relaxed.

07:51.199 --> 07:52.560
This is a real gold lump.

07:52.560 --> 07:54.079
I am a servant of the Jiang Mansion,

07:54.079 --> 07:56.439
completely reliant on My lord
for my livelihood.

08:00.720 --> 08:03.319
This red coral

08:03.319 --> 08:04.480
embodies my sincerity.

08:04.480 --> 08:06.560
If you don't give me a reason for refusal,

08:06.560 --> 08:08.319
I will stay here today.

08:09.079 --> 08:10.440
I will stay here.

08:12.360 --> 08:13.800
In that case,

08:13.800 --> 08:15.000
Mr. Feng, please

08:15.000 --> 08:18.360
bring your sincerity with you and come with me.

08:20.319 --> 08:22.079
What are you waiting for?

08:22.079 --> 08:23.656
Hurry up.

08:36.759 --> 08:38.152
Mr. Feng.

08:38.759 --> 08:40.720
This piece was offered by Mr. Bao,

08:40.720 --> 08:42.399
also transported from Qiongzhou.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.720
Mr. Feng, you'd better
to choose another new item.

08:45.720 --> 08:47.600
And try again on the fifteenth of next month.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.568
Lady He.

09:03.279 --> 09:04.879
The Epang Palace is lined
with ten thousand houses.

09:04.879 --> 09:06.399
There are layers of gates for guarding.

09:07.120 --> 09:08.399
I think that's it.

09:09.360 --> 09:10.720
Mr. Jiang grabbed the tail of the monster tiger

09:10.720 --> 09:12.120
with his left hand.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.279
His right hand just like this.

09:13.279 --> 09:14.519
Shoot three arrows at once

09:14.519 --> 09:16.320
at the monster.

09:16.320 --> 09:18.720
The demon's forehead, chest,

09:18.720 --> 09:20.799
and groin each struck by an arrow.

09:20.799 --> 09:23.960
It died on the spot.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.159
Good, good.

09:26.279 --> 09:29.440
Clouds billowing under Mr. Jiang's feet.

09:29.440 --> 09:31.039
Before I could even react,

09:31.039 --> 09:33.200
Mr. Jiang had already flown before me.

09:33.200 --> 09:34.919
I immediately knelt in worship, saying

09:34.919 --> 09:37.919
"Thank you for saving my life."

09:38.480 --> 09:39.840
But Mr. Jiang said,

09:41.120 --> 09:44.200
"Slaying demons and upholding justice.

09:44.200 --> 09:46.799
Mr. Yin, don't mention it."

09:47.519 --> 09:50.759
But how could I forget your kindness?

09:50.759 --> 09:52.000
Upon waking up,

09:52.000 --> 09:54.440
I immediately asked
the embroidery house to embroider this

09:54.440 --> 09:57.600
"Hero Jiang's Demon-Repelling Picture".

09:59.799 --> 10:01.840
No wonder I haven't been sleeping well.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.879
So I did such a grand deed

10:03.879 --> 10:05.840
in your dream.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.960
This should be acted in a play.

10:07.960 --> 10:10.120
I have already ordered someone to do it.

10:10.120 --> 10:13.000
I'm worried that even with the best actors,

10:13.000 --> 10:14.879
we still can't portray

10:14.879 --> 10:16.919
a fraction of your grace.

10:18.639 --> 10:20.759
I've done such a dashing deed,

10:20.759 --> 10:22.320
yet I don't remember it at all.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.759
What a pity.

10:24.759 --> 10:26.639
However, this matter is quite interesting.

10:26.639 --> 10:28.080
I can tell it to His Majesty.

10:28.960 --> 10:30.559
If His Majesty laughs at me,

10:30.559 --> 10:32.720
you must testify for me.

10:32.720 --> 10:34.519
Of course.

10:43.200 --> 10:45.360
These are a basket of magpie eggs.

10:45.360 --> 10:46.879
The divine bird in the dream

10:46.879 --> 10:48.639
entrusted me to offer them to you.

10:50.919 --> 10:52.480
You even

10:52.480 --> 10:53.759
brought me things from the dream.

10:53.759 --> 10:56.639
Of course, I should give you a return gift.

10:56.639 --> 10:59.440
Well…

11:00.480 --> 11:02.159
You're so nice, Mr. Jiang.

11:06.120 --> 11:07.960
This is a cricket?

11:09.759 --> 11:11.720
His Majesty has recently
indulged in cricket fighting,

11:11.720 --> 11:13.080
so he bestowed this

11:13.080 --> 11:14.360
victorious cricket to me.

11:15.039 --> 11:17.159
It has won twenty battles out of twenty.

11:17.799 --> 11:19.919
If you have nightmares again,

11:19.919 --> 11:22.519
let it slay demons on my behalf.

11:22.519 --> 11:24.120
So I won't have to come to your dream.

11:24.120 --> 11:26.320
This is an object bestowed by His Majesty.

11:26.320 --> 11:29.559
I am so grateful.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.639
The cricket has escaped.

11:43.919 --> 11:45.559
On the fifteenth of next month,

11:45.559 --> 11:47.720
you'll open the warehouse again?

11:47.720 --> 11:50.679
No, we'll move.

11:50.679 --> 11:51.960
Move?

11:51.960 --> 11:54.080
To move the items in the warehouse.

11:54.080 --> 11:55.600
Move those on the left to the right.

11:55.600 --> 11:57.120
And move those on the right to the back.

11:57.120 --> 11:58.399
My lord says

11:58.399 --> 11:59.799
once we move things away,

11:59.799 --> 12:01.240
there will be new space in the warehouse.

12:01.240 --> 12:02.879
Once with the new space,

12:02.879 --> 12:04.399
why not fill it up?

12:05.672 --> 12:07.000
Please.

12:07.000 --> 12:08.480
Your warehouse

12:08.480 --> 12:10.559
is just like Mr. Jiang's desire,

12:10.559 --> 12:11.879
can never be completely filled.

12:13.440 --> 12:14.720
We've spent so much money,

12:14.720 --> 12:16.120
only to get a cricket.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.559
It is quite a loss.

12:17.559 --> 12:18.879
Let me tell you.

12:18.879 --> 12:20.240
This is not just any cricket,

12:20.240 --> 12:21.720
but a message.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.840
If I can cater to His Majesty's preferences

12:23.840 --> 12:25.480
and greatly please him,

12:25.480 --> 12:27.840
then I can secure a position
as the Note-taking Official.

12:27.840 --> 12:30.279
I would then become someone
by the emperor's side.

12:31.440 --> 12:33.000
Mr. Jiang serving as the Floral Envoy

12:33.000 --> 12:34.639
is truly a waste of his talent.

12:34.639 --> 12:36.000
He should go to the Imperial Academy

12:36.000 --> 12:37.000
to impart knowledge and teach.

12:37.639 --> 12:38.679
That would really be

12:38.679 --> 12:40.279
exchanging gold and jade for advices.

12:40.279 --> 12:42.320
It's more valuable than knowledge in books.

12:44.440 --> 12:45.840
But he just betrayed His Majesty

12:45.840 --> 12:47.279
like this,

12:47.279 --> 12:49.240
isn't he afraid of His Majesty's blame?

12:49.799 --> 12:51.679
My lord and His Majesty

12:51.679 --> 12:52.879
have grown up together from childhood,

12:52.879 --> 12:54.519
as close as siblings.

12:54.519 --> 12:55.720
It's just about sharing the fun

12:55.720 --> 12:57.840
among friends.

12:58.440 --> 12:59.600
What a coincidence.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.639
Sharing the fun with others every time

13:01.639 --> 13:02.759
happens to be the fifteen day of the month.

13:07.279 --> 13:09.519
In order to accumulate wealth
with a just cause,

13:10.360 --> 13:12.080
Floral Envoy even

13:12.080 --> 13:13.720
used the auspicious days.

13:14.759 --> 13:15.960
In terms of

13:15.960 --> 13:17.679
using dirty tricks,

13:17.679 --> 13:19.320
he is truly amazing.

13:19.320 --> 13:21.360
I'm impressed.

13:21.360 --> 13:22.760
Lady He, please.

13:24.639 --> 13:26.600
However, I can also use the auspicious days

13:26.600 --> 13:27.960
to sell flowers.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.879
Perhaps it could

13:29.879 --> 13:31.159
take my business to the next level.

13:32.759 --> 13:34.344
My lord.

13:35.919 --> 13:37.679
If you want to steal my unique tricks,

13:37.679 --> 13:39.840
you have to pay me.

13:39.840 --> 13:41.679
Not at all. I wouldn't dare.

13:42.360 --> 13:43.960
I've almost finished touring.

13:44.480 --> 13:46.200
If there's nothing else,

13:46.200 --> 13:48.000
I will go water the plants first.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.840
May you be well.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.080
Wait.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.120
In my mansion,

13:55.039 --> 13:57.120
you speak ill of me to my guard.

13:57.879 --> 13:59.399
How bold you are.

14:02.480 --> 14:04.200
The true base person

14:04.200 --> 14:05.559
would hide

14:05.559 --> 14:07.200
all the filthy thoughts,

14:07.200 --> 14:09.080
just like the family of Liu Chang.

14:09.720 --> 14:12.440
Yet you receive the gifts and never hide it.

14:12.440 --> 14:13.720
And your most trusted guard

14:13.720 --> 14:15.200
tells me everything.

14:15.960 --> 14:18.039
I guess you wish me

14:18.039 --> 14:19.480
to spread it until everyone knows.

14:20.840 --> 14:21.960
In my opinion,

14:21.960 --> 14:23.279
you probably long for

14:23.279 --> 14:24.720
this notoriety,

14:25.320 --> 14:26.960
so you can hide

14:26.960 --> 14:28.320
something else.

14:35.759 --> 14:37.639
I still remember the copper coin

14:38.639 --> 14:39.879
that was shot away.

14:43.360 --> 14:44.799
Don't you want to know

14:46.000 --> 14:47.639
what I am hiding?

14:48.879 --> 14:50.639
Not at all.

14:50.639 --> 14:52.960
I am an ordinary citizen.

14:52.960 --> 14:53.960
Even my household registration

14:53.960 --> 14:56.039
has to be done by the help of you.

14:56.039 --> 14:57.679
How dare I know more?

15:07.080 --> 15:08.799
The Qiongtai Yulu is in the study.

15:11.879 --> 15:12.919
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

15:15.159 --> 15:16.360
Lady He, please.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.799
This grape wine

15:29.799 --> 15:31.120
is sent from Persia

15:31.120 --> 15:32.879
from a thousand miles away.

15:32.879 --> 15:34.759
County Princess, Zishu.

15:34.759 --> 15:36.360
If the two of you like it,

15:36.360 --> 15:38.320
on your big wedding day,

15:38.320 --> 15:40.759
I will take care of this drink.

15:42.679 --> 15:43.840
Here, everyone.

15:43.840 --> 15:44.960
Let's drink this cup to the full.

15:45.480 --> 15:47.048
Here.

15:50.840 --> 15:52.279
This wine is clear, sweet, refreshing,

15:52.279 --> 15:53.736
quite nice.

15:54.720 --> 15:56.840
Zishu, don't be fooled by him.

15:56.840 --> 15:59.200
He lost a bet with someone,

15:59.200 --> 16:01.840
and spent a fortune
to buy all the grape wine in Chang'an.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.559
He fears that he can't hide it at home

16:03.559 --> 16:05.279
and would be discovered by his father,

16:05.279 --> 16:06.919
so he wants us to help him with it.

16:08.120 --> 16:09.399
Brother.

16:09.399 --> 16:11.399
Prince Ning's Mansion doesn't lack anything.

16:11.399 --> 16:13.519
They couldn't appreciate this fruit wine.

16:13.519 --> 16:14.799
The first time visiting,

16:14.799 --> 16:17.080
I have also brought an item

16:17.840 --> 16:20.759
for you to enjoy.

16:22.559 --> 16:24.120
The work by Master Wu

16:24.120 --> 16:26.320
is magnificent and ingeniously crafted.

16:26.320 --> 16:27.879
A rare piece indeed.

16:27.879 --> 16:30.559
This is one of Master Wu's works
before he became famous,

16:30.559 --> 16:31.919
extremely rare.

16:31.919 --> 16:33.919
It is also treasured
by my father for many years.

16:33.919 --> 16:35.480
I hope you will like it.

16:37.039 --> 16:38.039
Zishu.

16:38.039 --> 16:39.679
Indeed, as County Princess says,

16:40.320 --> 16:43.159
you are elegant and charming.

16:43.159 --> 16:45.480
Even your taste in the calligraphy and painting

16:45.480 --> 16:47.720
is also extraordinary and refined.

16:48.720 --> 16:51.000
You gave me this.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.320
And I must give you something in return.

16:54.200 --> 16:55.519
Master Wu

16:55.519 --> 16:57.039
is skilled at painting people.

16:59.159 --> 17:00.919
Go to the study and bring

17:00.919 --> 17:02.200
"The Portrait of the Child-Giving God".

17:03.120 --> 17:04.840
Yes.

17:04.840 --> 17:06.640
"The Portrait of the Child-Giving God"?

17:08.279 --> 17:09.640
Wasn't it presented

17:09.640 --> 17:11.160
to His Majesty by Master Wu?

17:11.160 --> 17:12.720
How could it be?

17:12.720 --> 17:14.319
They are the founding nobles,

17:14.319 --> 17:15.759
often graced by His Majesty's rewards.

17:15.759 --> 17:16.759
To possess this painting

17:16.759 --> 17:18.200
is not surprised.

17:18.799 --> 17:20.599
Your sincerity is not enough.

17:21.359 --> 17:23.920
We have many Master Wu's paintings.

17:23.920 --> 17:25.680
County Princess,

17:25.680 --> 17:27.480
you accompany Mr. Liu to choose one.

17:27.480 --> 17:29.160
Just take

17:29.160 --> 17:30.680
whatever you like.

17:32.680 --> 17:34.599
His paintings are worth a fortune
and hard to obtain.

17:35.279 --> 17:37.400
The Jia family's collections
did not come easily either.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.640
"The Portrait of the Child-Giving God"
is enough for me.

17:39.640 --> 17:41.680
How dare I take another one?

17:43.279 --> 17:44.759
My father and Master Wu

17:44.759 --> 17:46.160
have been close friends for years,

17:46.160 --> 17:47.759
and our families are also longtime friends.

17:47.759 --> 17:49.519
Zishu, don't be shy.

17:49.519 --> 17:50.839
If the two of you like it,

17:50.839 --> 17:52.440
I will have someone invite him over

17:52.440 --> 17:54.680
to create a new painting
for you both on the spot.

17:54.680 --> 17:55.880
How about that?

17:57.079 --> 17:58.400
That would be great.

17:59.400 --> 18:00.519
What do you think, Zishu?

18:07.279 --> 18:09.119
We have been drinking
in this room the whole time.

18:09.119 --> 18:10.559
It's a bit boring.

18:10.559 --> 18:11.839
Why not go to the side of the agate pool

18:11.839 --> 18:13.119
to play drinking games?

18:13.119 --> 18:14.119
Let's see today

18:14.119 --> 18:15.839
who can leave sober.

18:15.839 --> 18:16.880
- Okay.
- Okay.

18:16.880 --> 18:17.759
- Let's go.
- Okay.

18:17.759 --> 18:19.016
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

18:20.440 --> 18:22.088
- Come on.
- Come.

18:24.759 --> 18:25.960
Zishu, let's go.

18:27.200 --> 18:28.359
You go ahead first.

18:28.920 --> 18:30.000
We'll go ahead.

18:31.480 --> 18:32.920
Mr. Jia.

18:32.920 --> 18:34.880
I heard you are working
at the Ministry of Works.

18:34.880 --> 18:37.319
Well, I have an essay on water transport

18:37.319 --> 18:38.799
and would like to discuss with you.

18:42.359 --> 18:43.519
We are

18:43.519 --> 18:44.960
born in a wealthy family.

18:45.599 --> 18:46.640
So, we should

18:46.640 --> 18:48.039
live at the moment.

18:48.039 --> 18:49.440
Why discuss it?

18:50.400 --> 18:52.119
The heavy burdens of governing

18:52.720 --> 18:54.400
should be left

18:54.400 --> 18:55.400
to those minor officials

18:55.400 --> 18:56.839
with humble background.

19:12.319 --> 19:13.680
I think the gift I sent

19:13.680 --> 19:14.880
is elegant and refined,

19:15.640 --> 19:17.240
but in fact, they despised on it.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.240
Better not to send it at all.

19:20.240 --> 19:22.319
That Mr. Jia has many fine paintings,

19:22.319 --> 19:23.920
but he doesn't appreciate them.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.839
How can he compare with
your talents and ambitions?

19:28.480 --> 19:29.640
Nobles possess

19:29.640 --> 19:31.799
wealth that others can hardly
accumulate in a lifetime,

19:31.799 --> 19:33.400
yet only seek pleasure,

19:33.400 --> 19:35.079
without any ambition.

19:36.519 --> 19:39.480
Thinking that I will inevitably
have to socialize with them,

19:40.640 --> 19:42.200
making me feel weary.

20:03.720 --> 20:04.799
In the past, only the nobles

20:04.799 --> 20:05.920
could afford peonies.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.960
Thanks to that flower-selling woman,

20:07.960 --> 20:10.160
mow we can afford them too.

20:10.160 --> 20:12.519
This Huaixiuxiang is smaller
than the average peony,

20:12.519 --> 20:13.960
but has full and round flowers.

20:13.960 --> 20:15.440
It's perfect for decorating the house.

20:15.440 --> 20:18.279
Yes, I heard that woman
is from Qingliang Mountain.

20:19.319 --> 20:20.559
My lord.

20:20.559 --> 20:22.680
What does that flower-selling woman look like?

20:23.200 --> 20:24.584
Zishu.

20:26.480 --> 20:28.200
What are you doing here?

20:28.920 --> 20:30.119
He must get drunk

20:30.119 --> 20:31.640
from helping you fend off drinks,

20:31.640 --> 20:33.880
so he came out to take a walk.

20:34.480 --> 20:36.359
The Jia Mansion is too big, so I got lost.

20:37.559 --> 20:38.960
Are you feeling unwell?

20:41.640 --> 20:44.119
After Mr. Liu marries County Princess,

20:44.119 --> 20:45.160
the mansion you will live in

20:45.160 --> 20:47.119
will be much bigger than mine.

20:47.119 --> 20:48.519
By then,

20:48.519 --> 20:50.599
you must stick close to County Princess.

20:50.599 --> 20:52.079
Don't do it like today.

20:52.079 --> 20:53.680
You've only lost for a moment,

20:53.680 --> 20:55.359
and she got so worried.

20:55.920 --> 20:56.960
You!

21:01.599 --> 21:03.279
What are they holding?

21:04.079 --> 21:05.559
Peonies?

21:05.559 --> 21:08.039
Since when did your family
use such inferior goods

21:08.039 --> 21:09.480
to decorate the courtyard?

21:09.480 --> 21:11.000
Why do you get such vulgar things?

21:13.400 --> 21:15.160
We bought these flowers for ourselves.

21:15.160 --> 21:16.759
We were just about to take them
to the servants' room.

21:16.759 --> 21:18.079
Sorry for being seen by you.

21:18.079 --> 21:19.200
We'll take them away now.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.192
Hurry.

21:24.079 --> 21:25.119
Please forgive me.

21:25.920 --> 21:27.640
Zishu, let's go,

21:27.640 --> 21:29.279
lest we get dirtied.

21:35.359 --> 21:37.599
Some people are just like this flower,

21:37.599 --> 21:39.079
incompatible with

21:39.079 --> 21:40.160
this luxurious mansion.

21:42.079 --> 21:43.528
I'll take my leave.

22:03.880 --> 22:05.000
In the past, only the nobles

22:05.000 --> 22:06.079
could afford peonies.

22:06.079 --> 22:08.119
Thanks to that flower-selling woman,

22:08.119 --> 22:10.400
now we can afford them too.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.759
Don't go back yet.

22:13.759 --> 22:14.952
Make a trip to the flower market.

22:14.952 --> 22:15.960
Yes.

22:16.759 --> 22:18.344
Turn right ahead.

22:27.519 --> 22:29.559
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

22:29.559 --> 22:31.799
- Potted peonies should not be watered too much.
- Got it. Understood.

22:31.799 --> 22:33.160
It is not…

22:35.559 --> 22:36.720
We've already pushed the price of the flowers

22:36.720 --> 22:38.039
down to the lowest,

22:38.039 --> 22:39.279
but after deducting the cost

22:39.279 --> 22:41.079
and the bonus to the Floral Envoy,

22:41.079 --> 22:43.400
there isn't much left in the monthly profit.

22:43.400 --> 22:44.519
It's okay. Take it slow.

22:44.519 --> 22:45.839
We will save up more.

22:48.359 --> 22:50.079
Once the flowering period
of this Huaixiuxiang is over,

22:50.079 --> 22:52.279
we'll have to find other low-priced peonies.

22:52.279 --> 22:54.440
We have to keep providing
potted peonies for sale,

22:54.440 --> 22:55.680
then we can retain customers.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.840
Good.

22:57.440 --> 22:59.680
Shengyi, it's still early.
You can go home first.

22:59.680 --> 23:01.279
I'll go check out the florists in the suburbs.

23:02.119 --> 23:03.200
I'll clean up here.

23:03.200 --> 23:04.440
- You go ahead.
- I'm leaving now.

23:13.960 --> 23:15.336
Excuse me.

23:17.079 --> 23:19.400
Do you sell Huaixiuxiang here?

23:26.240 --> 23:27.400
Could this be…?

23:34.119 --> 23:35.559
I paid a lot for this

23:35.559 --> 23:37.079
Fire Gold Peony.

23:37.079 --> 23:38.319
You have to compensate for me.

23:38.319 --> 23:39.624
Well…

23:41.160 --> 23:42.400
Are you alright?

23:42.400 --> 23:43.656
I'm fine.

23:44.960 --> 23:46.480
How much did this flower cost?

23:47.119 --> 23:48.319
Twenty strings.

23:49.000 --> 23:50.079
What?

23:50.079 --> 23:51.528
Twenty strings?

23:52.279 --> 23:54.519
This is literally asking for my life.

23:55.160 --> 23:56.240
You've been deceived.

23:56.240 --> 23:58.319
Go find that swindler.

23:58.319 --> 23:59.400
Don't talk nonsense.

23:59.400 --> 24:01.279
This flower of mine

24:01.279 --> 24:02.440
was worth this price,

24:03.000 --> 24:04.279
but this old fold

24:04.279 --> 24:06.839
- destroyed the flower with his donkey.
- Well…

24:06.839 --> 24:08.079
Please judge.

24:08.079 --> 24:09.359
You have truly been deceived.

24:09.359 --> 24:11.039
Your flower seems nice,

24:11.039 --> 24:13.200
but its stem hasn't grown well at all.

24:13.200 --> 24:15.359
It's a Chinese peony in its first year,

24:15.359 --> 24:17.759
failing to pinch the buds
and causing the insufficient nutrients.

24:17.759 --> 24:19.799
This flower this year
is definitely not going to bloom.

24:21.279 --> 24:22.799
That's strange.

24:22.799 --> 24:24.039
Logically speaking,

24:24.039 --> 24:25.880
a renowned variety like Fire Gold Peony

24:25.880 --> 24:27.519
should be cared for by a gardener.

24:28.279 --> 24:30.240
I understand now. I guess some

24:30.240 --> 24:31.440
servant in the noble mansion

24:31.440 --> 24:32.799
stole this flower

24:32.799 --> 24:33.839
and can't maintain it,

24:33.839 --> 24:34.880
now it won't survive

24:34.880 --> 24:36.559
and they deceived you.

24:36.559 --> 24:38.559
This has nothing to do with you.
Don't talk nonsense here.

24:38.559 --> 24:40.720
- He's deceived by someone.
- Old folk.

24:40.720 --> 24:42.440
Today, you either compensate,

24:42.440 --> 24:44.160
or come with me to the yamen. Come on.

24:44.160 --> 24:45.400
I truly can't pay it.

24:45.400 --> 24:47.160
My lord, don't do this.

24:47.160 --> 24:49.359
To the yamen, right? I'll go with you.

24:49.359 --> 24:50.440
I'll be a witness.

24:50.440 --> 24:51.599
The swindler is so despicable,

24:52.119 --> 24:54.079
stealing flowers and deceiving for money.

24:54.079 --> 24:55.839
He must be at least punished
with fifty heavy beatings.

24:56.799 --> 24:58.519
Forget it, old folk.

24:58.519 --> 25:00.279
You are advanced in age.

25:00.279 --> 25:02.319
I won't make it difficult for you.

25:02.319 --> 25:03.960
Just give me three strings,

25:03.960 --> 25:05.000
and let's settle this privately.

25:05.000 --> 25:07.480
I don't even have three strings.

25:07.480 --> 25:10.519
No way. We can't let the swindle go.
Let's go to the yamen.

25:10.519 --> 25:11.759
There's no need for that.

25:11.759 --> 25:12.839
We must punish the swindle.

25:12.839 --> 25:14.440
I-I have urgent matters to attend to.

25:14.440 --> 25:16.960
My wife is about to give birth soon,

25:16.960 --> 25:18.472
she's waiting for me at home.

25:19.319 --> 25:20.392
Is that so?

25:21.160 --> 25:23.559
Otherwise, you sell this flower to me.

25:23.559 --> 25:25.279
Consider it me being swindled.

25:25.279 --> 25:27.160
I will go look for the swindler with him,

25:27.160 --> 25:28.519
if we can't,

25:28.519 --> 25:30.079
I'll just accept my bad luck.

25:30.079 --> 25:31.400
Well…

25:31.400 --> 25:32.599
But right now,

25:33.440 --> 25:34.680
I only have this much money.

25:34.680 --> 25:35.680
Just this?

25:36.559 --> 25:38.720
Right, you've spent twenty strings.

25:38.720 --> 25:40.440
Forget it, let's go to the yamen.

25:40.440 --> 25:41.640
Let's go. To report to the yamen.

25:41.640 --> 25:42.680
No need.

25:42.680 --> 25:44.119
Alright, I'm having bad luck.

25:44.119 --> 25:45.160
Come on, hurry up.

25:45.160 --> 25:46.599
The swindler is himself.

25:46.599 --> 25:47.944
Right.

25:49.319 --> 25:51.920
You haven't said who the swindler is yet.

25:51.920 --> 25:54.400
Sir, the swindler is himself.

25:54.400 --> 25:55.440
I just saw with my own eyes

25:55.440 --> 25:56.680
that he injured your donkey.

25:56.680 --> 25:58.960
He's putting on this act just to fool you.

25:59.839 --> 26:01.039
I see.

26:04.440 --> 26:05.736
My lord.

26:06.839 --> 26:08.400
Do you think

26:08.400 --> 26:09.960
that the woman selling flowers

26:09.960 --> 26:11.000
is Young Madam?

26:13.440 --> 26:14.519
I've always felt

26:15.079 --> 26:17.279
she wouldn't disappear
from this world that easily.

26:19.400 --> 26:21.160
But the Buyao at the edge of the cliff

26:21.160 --> 26:22.519
indeed belongs to her.

26:24.319 --> 26:25.736
I know.

26:28.079 --> 26:29.359
Towards Young Madam…

26:32.440 --> 26:33.559
He Weifang

26:34.160 --> 26:35.160
had been married to me for a year,

26:35.960 --> 26:37.599
and I only realized

26:37.599 --> 26:39.799
what kind of person she really was
until the last few days,

26:40.559 --> 26:43.599
and how the Liu family have failed her.

26:45.839 --> 26:47.160
I used to be indifferent to her.

26:47.920 --> 26:49.720
I really intended to make amends.

26:50.599 --> 26:52.240
What a pity.

26:52.240 --> 26:53.599
There's no opportunity anymore.

26:57.599 --> 26:58.920
I'm fine.

26:58.920 --> 27:01.279
Thank you for helping me.

27:01.839 --> 27:03.359
- You're welcome.
- Thank you.

27:03.359 --> 27:04.559
- Take care.
- Okay.

27:04.559 --> 27:05.640
- After you.
- Okay.

27:06.720 --> 27:07.848
Take it slow.

27:24.319 --> 27:25.736
He Weifang.

27:32.240 --> 27:33.384
He Weifang.

27:33.384 --> 27:34.519
Wait.

27:35.160 --> 27:37.720
He Weifang.

27:37.720 --> 27:38.839
- Let go of me.
- He Weifang.

27:38.839 --> 27:40.519
- Let go of me.
- Why do you run upon seeing me?

27:40.519 --> 27:42.079
Why did you pretend to die?

27:42.079 --> 27:43.200
I am dead.

27:43.200 --> 27:44.880
Is that not just
what the Liu family wished for?

27:46.559 --> 27:47.880
That was my parents' wish,

27:47.880 --> 27:49.039
not what I wished for.

27:49.680 --> 27:51.799
Your parents could take possession of my dowry.

27:51.799 --> 27:53.640
You could marry County Princess.

27:53.640 --> 27:55.720
And I could start afresh

27:55.720 --> 27:57.079
with a new identity.

27:57.079 --> 27:58.079
Liu Chang.

27:58.079 --> 27:59.559
I'm begging you.

27:59.559 --> 28:01.200
Please show mercy and spare me.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.240
Start afresh?

28:05.240 --> 28:07.720
Is this what situation you are in?

28:07.720 --> 28:09.400
Disheveled and in a sorry state.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.400
How have you been spending your days?

28:12.400 --> 28:13.759
Have you been working as a servant for someone?

28:15.079 --> 28:16.319
I have my own means of livelihood.

28:16.839 --> 28:17.920
Don't worry about me.

28:23.039 --> 28:24.119
Are you selling flowers?

28:26.240 --> 28:27.759
So the flower-selling woman is really you.

28:33.559 --> 28:34.880
For the Liu family,

28:34.880 --> 28:36.319
I had to marry County Princess.

28:37.079 --> 28:39.119
But I am not a person

28:39.119 --> 28:40.680
who's not ungrateful and abandon his wife.

28:42.079 --> 28:44.000
Liu Chang.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.039
From beginning to end,

28:45.039 --> 28:47.279
we were never truly husband and wife.

28:47.279 --> 28:49.240
And now we have already divorced.

28:49.240 --> 28:51.319
Why would you rather
be a lowly flower merchant,

28:51.319 --> 28:52.759
rather than returning to me?

28:55.200 --> 28:57.200
If there were no merchants or farmers,

28:57.200 --> 28:58.960
where would the clothes you wear,
the things you use at home

28:58.960 --> 29:00.160
come from?

29:00.720 --> 29:02.480
I earn money with my own effort.

29:02.480 --> 29:04.440
I have never felt that I am lowly.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.440
That's not what I mean.

29:07.920 --> 29:09.240
Now I have seen you clearly.

29:10.400 --> 29:11.720
I misunderstood you in the past.

29:13.759 --> 29:15.039
He Weifang.

29:15.039 --> 29:16.240
Can you calm down

29:16.240 --> 29:17.839
and get to know me again?

29:18.759 --> 29:20.680
I did not sign the divorce agreement.

29:22.119 --> 29:23.519
As long as you are willing to…

29:23.519 --> 29:24.720
Liu Chang.

29:24.720 --> 29:26.079
I wanted to

29:26.079 --> 29:28.119
leave you some dignity.

29:28.119 --> 29:29.200
But you are relentless,

29:29.200 --> 29:30.880
and I really can't stand it.

29:31.559 --> 29:33.000
Your parents coveted my dowry,

29:33.000 --> 29:34.599
and even sent someone to kill me.

29:35.240 --> 29:37.240
They forced my father to abandon me,

29:37.240 --> 29:38.839
leaving me with no home to return to.

29:39.640 --> 29:40.720
You used fake medicine

29:40.720 --> 29:42.000
to deceive me into marrying you,

29:42.000 --> 29:44.319
causing me to miss the opportunity
to treat my mother,

29:44.319 --> 29:45.680
leading to her untimely death.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.200
Between you and me,

29:48.839 --> 29:49.839
except for hatred,

29:50.559 --> 29:51.960
there is no other possibility.

29:52.920 --> 29:54.000
Your mother passed away from illness.

29:54.000 --> 29:56.039
This is really my Liu family's fault.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.408
I can't deny it.

29:59.920 --> 30:01.400
But, I was unaware.

30:02.240 --> 30:03.480
If you are willing now,

30:03.480 --> 30:05.480
I can steal the Zixi pill for you.

30:06.440 --> 30:08.240
Whether you keep it, or take it…

30:08.240 --> 30:10.039
My mother has already died.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.880
Why do I want this Zixi pill?

30:16.160 --> 30:17.416
Liu Chang.

30:19.079 --> 30:20.440
Whatever you have done,

30:20.440 --> 30:22.160
to me, it is all the same.

30:23.559 --> 30:24.712
My mother

30:25.640 --> 30:26.920
has gone.

30:34.079 --> 30:35.208
He Weifang.

30:35.720 --> 30:36.920
He Weifang.

30:36.920 --> 30:38.079
- What are you going to do?
- Listen to me.

30:38.680 --> 30:39.759
Whatever the Liu family and I have done,

30:39.759 --> 30:41.160
I admit all of it.

30:41.160 --> 30:42.359
Give me a chance to make amends.

30:42.359 --> 30:44.200
I can take good care of you for your mother.

30:44.799 --> 30:46.319
I know you like to grow flowers,

30:46.319 --> 30:48.079
so I can arrange a garden for you.

30:48.079 --> 30:49.519
You no longer need to be looked down upon,

30:49.519 --> 30:50.839
worry about making a living,

30:50.839 --> 30:52.079
work hard day and night.

30:52.079 --> 30:53.240
You can live an easy life.

30:54.319 --> 30:55.759
What do you take me for?

30:55.759 --> 30:57.240
A kept woman?

30:57.839 --> 30:58.920
Liu Chang.

30:58.920 --> 31:00.400
This is what you call seeing me clearly?

31:00.400 --> 31:01.400
That's not what I mean.

31:02.119 --> 31:03.640
I just want to protect you well.

31:03.640 --> 31:05.599
I don't want you to face the difficulties
from my parents and County Princess.

31:05.599 --> 31:07.079
If you really want to protect me,

31:08.000 --> 31:09.759
then don't tell anyone that I am still alive,

31:10.599 --> 31:12.359
or appear in front of me again.

31:13.319 --> 31:14.319
Excuse me.

31:15.400 --> 31:16.680
Come on.

31:17.480 --> 31:19.279
He Weifang.

31:19.279 --> 31:20.319
When we married, you were unwilling,

31:20.319 --> 31:21.480
and so were I.

31:21.480 --> 31:22.799
Now He Weifang is dead,

31:22.799 --> 31:23.960
and you are free as well.

31:24.680 --> 31:26.000
Do not bother me anymore.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.536
He Weifang.

31:42.680 --> 31:44.759
She is not dead.

31:44.759 --> 31:45.799
Don't worry.

31:46.880 --> 31:48.296
Rest assured.

31:51.440 --> 31:53.680
Annoying Liu Chang, Liu Chang is annoying.

32:04.240 --> 32:06.000
I was totally

32:06.000 --> 32:07.160
wrong about her

32:07.880 --> 32:09.224
and underestimated her.

32:11.039 --> 32:12.559
She comes from a merchant family,

32:13.720 --> 32:15.200
yet she possesses integrity,

32:15.200 --> 32:16.240
with extraordinary insight.

32:17.279 --> 32:18.440
Just like me,

32:18.440 --> 32:20.000
we all want to make our name by our own.

32:23.799 --> 32:25.039
It's just a pity

32:28.000 --> 32:29.680
that it took me so long to realize.

32:35.279 --> 32:36.552
Shuai.

32:37.160 --> 32:39.119
Do I really have no chance to make amends?

32:41.559 --> 32:44.079
I like Mudan.

32:46.400 --> 32:47.920
What am I doing?

32:49.880 --> 32:51.119
What do you like about her?

32:52.119 --> 32:53.960
Her defiant coldness,

32:53.960 --> 32:55.039
her hostility in words,

33:00.079 --> 33:01.839
or her situation

33:03.119 --> 33:04.799
of being free and unrestrained?

33:15.440 --> 33:17.440
He dared to deceive
an old person in the street!

33:18.079 --> 33:20.240
That person is truly shameless.

33:20.240 --> 33:21.960
Yes. So,

33:21.960 --> 33:23.519
I just came forward

33:23.519 --> 33:24.960
and lent the old person a hand.

33:24.960 --> 33:26.720
So I got this.

33:27.880 --> 33:29.319
Shengyi.

33:29.319 --> 33:31.799
This peony is really Fire Gold Peony.

33:31.799 --> 33:34.240
If we could save it,

33:34.240 --> 33:35.240
then this pot

33:35.240 --> 33:36.440
could fetch a sky-high price.

33:37.640 --> 33:40.799
Right. Go buy some mangrove bark.

33:40.799 --> 33:42.200
Use it to soak in water and water the flowers.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.240
It can promote rooting.

33:44.559 --> 33:45.896
Go ahead.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.559
Mr. Third, let's drink.

34:06.279 --> 34:07.960
I won.

34:07.960 --> 34:08.960
Drink.

34:08.960 --> 34:11.280
I'm not playing anymore. I lose anyway.

34:11.280 --> 34:14.639
Mr. Pan, you'll have to drink this for me.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.119
No cheating.

34:22.719 --> 34:25.079
The lead courtesan of Huanyun Tower

34:25.079 --> 34:26.480
played the wrong note,

34:26.480 --> 34:28.000
yet didn't notice it?

34:29.760 --> 34:30.800
I'm sorry

34:30.800 --> 34:32.760
that I distracted

34:32.760 --> 34:34.199
by the beauty kites in the sky.

34:34.199 --> 34:35.679
Please forgive me.

34:38.360 --> 34:40.360
You distracted

34:40.360 --> 34:41.880
by such little kites?

34:44.039 --> 34:45.719
Bring over my kite.

34:45.719 --> 34:46.719
Yes.

34:46.719 --> 34:47.760
Let me show you

34:47.760 --> 34:49.760
how to overshadow the sky.

34:49.760 --> 34:50.920
- Good.
- Good.

34:51.519 --> 34:52.800
Is this a phoenix? It's truly exquisite.

34:52.800 --> 34:54.519
I've never seen

34:54.519 --> 34:55.599
such a big kite.

34:55.599 --> 34:57.239
- Right?
- Look.

34:57.239 --> 34:58.760
Are these feathers real?

34:58.760 --> 35:00.199
- You guess.
- I don't know.

35:00.199 --> 35:02.679
- You guess.
- Mr. Third.

35:02.679 --> 35:04.280
As a man with a wife,

35:04.280 --> 35:06.119
competing with us for the ladies' affection.

35:06.119 --> 35:07.559
You!

35:07.559 --> 35:09.360
- Exactly.
- Alright.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.480
I'm just tired of holding it.

35:10.480 --> 35:12.719
- Come on. Help me.
- You have a good taste.

35:12.719 --> 35:13.920
Yesterday, I played polo with you,

35:13.920 --> 35:15.159
and now my left arms sore.

35:15.159 --> 35:17.719
Fly your own phoenix kite yourself.

35:17.719 --> 35:19.639
Stop nagging, lest you complain about it.

35:19.639 --> 35:20.712
Take it.

35:22.239 --> 35:23.840
- It has flown away.
- The kite has flown away.

35:23.840 --> 35:24.960
The kite has flown away.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.079
It has flown to the backyard.

35:31.159 --> 35:32.920
It took

35:32.920 --> 35:34.480
two months to make this kite.

35:36.880 --> 35:37.960
Now,

35:37.960 --> 35:39.599
it's all in the Jiang Mansion.

35:39.599 --> 35:41.440
Just send someone to pick it up.

35:42.280 --> 35:43.679
That wine-making backyard

35:43.679 --> 35:44.800
has been neglected for years.

35:44.800 --> 35:46.519
Inside it's all tattered and torn.

35:46.519 --> 35:48.039
Even if picked up, it would be dirty.

35:48.599 --> 35:50.320
Forget it.

35:50.320 --> 35:52.119
Now that the courtyard has been taken care of.

35:52.119 --> 35:53.608
Someone lives there.

35:54.960 --> 35:56.639
Who?

35:56.639 --> 35:58.519
Just a peasant girl who grows flowers.

36:05.360 --> 36:06.920
The kite that the corrupt official flies

36:06.920 --> 36:08.800
is so extravagant and wasteful.

36:11.039 --> 36:12.480
These feathers

36:12.480 --> 36:13.639
all came from the bonus

36:13.639 --> 36:14.880
I gave him.

36:26.599 --> 36:28.920
Suizhi, you are hiding a beauty here?

36:28.920 --> 36:30.440
Then I must go take a look.

36:30.440 --> 36:32.079
She's just renting here.

36:32.079 --> 36:33.760
I'm not hiding her.

36:33.760 --> 36:35.360
Besides, there is a door bolt.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.400
You can't just go in.

36:39.280 --> 36:41.760
Mr. Third.

36:41.760 --> 36:43.336
Suizhi.

36:44.639 --> 36:46.039
Mr. Third.

36:46.039 --> 36:48.199
Come down, Mr. Third.

36:48.199 --> 36:50.079
Mr. Third.

36:50.079 --> 36:51.639
Come down.

36:51.639 --> 36:53.280
What are you doing?

36:53.280 --> 36:54.519
You just twisted your waist
playing polo yesterday,

36:54.519 --> 36:55.679
yet you're still messing around here.

36:55.679 --> 36:57.000
You've played among women for so many years,

36:57.000 --> 36:58.280
and it's the first time
you brought a woman home.

36:58.280 --> 37:00.159
I must see who she is.

37:00.159 --> 37:01.639
Just right, support me.

37:01.639 --> 37:03.000
Wait, what? Leave.

37:03.679 --> 37:06.199
Stop it. I'll just take a glance.

37:06.719 --> 37:08.639
- Just one glance.
- Hurry, support me.

37:08.639 --> 37:09.719
- Just one glance.
- Just one glance.

37:10.840 --> 37:11.880
Come on. Take it slow.

37:11.880 --> 37:13.288
Hold on tight!

37:15.920 --> 37:16.719
- Wait.
- Take it slow.

37:16.719 --> 37:18.480
- Harder.
- Grab onto it firmly.

37:18.480 --> 37:19.559
Harder.

37:24.159 --> 37:25.239
Terrible.

37:37.639 --> 37:38.960
- Jiang Changyang.
- Jiang Changyang.

37:42.519 --> 37:43.840
This Fire Gold Peony of mine

37:44.480 --> 37:46.159
is extremely precious.

37:46.159 --> 37:47.239
Smashed just like that by your friend,

37:47.239 --> 37:48.719
its stems have all broken.

37:48.719 --> 37:50.599
I'm afraid it's likely doomed.

37:50.599 --> 37:52.519
I demand compensation from you.
That's not too much to ask, right?

37:53.239 --> 37:54.440
Well…

37:55.159 --> 37:56.960
The Fire Gold Peony
is very difficult to care for,

37:56.960 --> 37:58.320
with a low survival rate.

37:58.320 --> 38:00.000
Even without today's incident,

38:00.000 --> 38:01.480
you might not have been able
to grow it successfully.

38:01.480 --> 38:03.679
It was you who failed
to keep an eye on your friend,

38:03.679 --> 38:05.559
how come you are questioning me?

38:05.559 --> 38:06.920
You're the one making outrageous demands first,

38:06.920 --> 38:08.440
of course, I would question you.

38:08.440 --> 38:09.760
- You!
- What?

38:09.760 --> 38:11.639
This flower woman is quite attractive,

38:11.639 --> 38:13.159
but why is she money-grubbing?

38:13.159 --> 38:14.239
Having such a good opportunity…

38:14.239 --> 38:15.920
No wonder Suizhi wouldn't let us see.

38:15.920 --> 38:17.880
She's quite vulgar.

38:18.519 --> 38:19.639
However, the scene where Mr. Third smashed

38:19.639 --> 38:21.760
into the flowers was indeed rare to witness.

38:21.760 --> 38:24.039
Tomorrow I'll have to talk about it to Mr. Jia.

38:24.039 --> 38:25.639
Furthermore, no one knows

38:25.639 --> 38:26.679
if it's the real Fire Gold Peony,

38:26.679 --> 38:27.920
or fake.

38:28.920 --> 38:30.599
Mr. Jiang, in order to shrink your blame,

38:30.599 --> 38:32.920
you really can beat around the bush.

38:32.920 --> 38:34.679
You are usually so generous

38:34.679 --> 38:36.199
to those beauties.

38:36.199 --> 38:38.360
Why are you unwilling
to be generous for your friend?

38:39.719 --> 38:43.119
Sir, you've made a bad friend.

38:43.119 --> 38:44.760
Now that you see who he really is,

38:44.760 --> 38:47.440
- you must feel quite upset.
- You!

38:47.440 --> 38:48.800
What? Stop it.

38:55.800 --> 38:58.360
Maybe I'll say something.

39:00.320 --> 39:02.360
Alright. Go ahead.

39:04.639 --> 39:06.199
May I know your name?

39:08.400 --> 39:09.760
Don't be that polite.

39:11.679 --> 39:13.239
The person who named me

39:13.840 --> 39:15.880
fell seriously ill.

39:16.480 --> 39:18.760
I fear my humble name
would not be pleasant to your ears.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.239
You may call me Mudan.

39:21.599 --> 39:23.159
Mudan.

39:23.159 --> 39:25.320
May I know you name?

39:26.079 --> 39:28.480
What a coincidence. My name
is also not very pleasant to the ear.

39:29.119 --> 39:30.480
I am the third in my family.

39:30.480 --> 39:32.559
Lady Mudan, you may call me Mr. Third.

39:34.239 --> 39:36.800
Mr. Third. I'm not being fussing.

39:36.800 --> 39:38.519
We run a small-scale business,

39:38.519 --> 39:41.000
and this smash from you is so disastrous.

39:41.760 --> 39:43.119
I am the one who broke the flower,

39:43.119 --> 39:44.239
so I should be the one to compensate.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.599
Suizhi defended me

39:46.599 --> 39:48.119
just out of fear that I would be at a loss.

39:48.119 --> 39:49.679
Lady Mudan, don't be mad at him.

39:51.920 --> 39:53.360
I am willing to place an order for this flower.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.639
If you can truly grow

39:54.639 --> 39:56.000
the Fire Gold Peony,

39:56.000 --> 39:57.559
no matter the price,

39:57.559 --> 39:59.239
I will buy it.

39:59.239 --> 40:00.320
But if you can't,

40:00.960 --> 40:02.679
then you have no proof.

40:02.679 --> 40:04.599
At that time, I will compensate
according to the price of ordinary flowers

40:04.599 --> 40:06.679
to you. How does that sound?

40:09.119 --> 40:11.840
Mr. Third, you are truly reasonable,

40:11.840 --> 40:12.920
not like someone.

40:13.440 --> 40:15.679
If that's the case,
I am willing to draft an agreement,

40:15.679 --> 40:17.840
lest someone accuses me of extortion.

40:18.840 --> 40:20.679
You are so magnanimous,

40:20.679 --> 40:21.800
certainly will not refuse

40:21.800 --> 40:22.840
sign the agreement.

40:22.840 --> 40:24.239
You are afraid he will deny the debt.

40:24.239 --> 40:26.320
Do you think your friends would deny the debt?

40:28.719 --> 40:29.960
Of course not.

40:29.960 --> 40:31.592
Right, Mr. Third?

40:46.760 --> 40:47.976
Wuniang.

40:50.039 --> 40:51.159
Wuniang, do not be afraid.

40:51.159 --> 40:52.280
I am here to buy flowers.

40:55.880 --> 40:58.119
Huaixiuxiang, eighty wens per pot.

41:03.079 --> 41:04.639
Seeing that you are doing well now,

41:05.519 --> 41:06.639
I can rest assured.

41:11.960 --> 41:13.480
What do you want?

41:13.480 --> 41:15.440
Wuniang, come back to me.

41:15.440 --> 41:16.840
I lost my soul after you left.

41:16.840 --> 41:18.039
Nothing feels meaningful.

41:18.039 --> 41:19.719
The newly hired helpers are even so lazy.

41:19.719 --> 41:21.840
And the tavern's business
gets worse day by day.

41:21.840 --> 41:24.119
Without you, I really can't live on.

41:26.320 --> 41:28.639
It was you who wanted to sell me.

41:28.639 --> 41:29.840
I was just so furious,

41:30.599 --> 41:31.840
and wanted to scare you.

41:31.840 --> 41:33.039
I didn't want to sell you.

41:33.800 --> 41:34.880
It's all because of Mudan.

41:34.880 --> 41:36.480
She instigated the nobles to pressure me.

41:36.480 --> 41:38.199
I really had no choice.

41:38.199 --> 41:40.519
Wuniang, I miss you so much.

41:40.519 --> 41:41.840
Wuniang.

41:41.840 --> 41:42.960
I really miss you so much.

41:42.960 --> 41:44.199
She is not Qin Wuniang.

41:44.199 --> 41:45.960
- So many people here.
- I truly can't leave…

41:45.960 --> 41:47.039
Let her go.

41:49.400 --> 41:51.519
You are no longer Qin Wuniang.

41:51.519 --> 41:53.039
You are Qin Shengyi.

41:53.039 --> 41:54.840
Don't fear that man anymore.

42:13.822 --> 42:20.096
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:21.950 --> 42:28.634
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:29.310 --> 42:36.508
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:37.502 --> 42:45.854
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:45.854 --> 42:53.397
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:54.051 --> 43:02.238
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

43:02.238 --> 43:10.049
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:10.654 --> 43:17.946
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:38.622 --> 43:45.505
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:46.806 --> 43:53.500
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the fragrant garden ♫

43:54.257 --> 44:01.559
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

44:02.243 --> 44:10.552
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

44:10.552 --> 44:17.983
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:18.814 --> 44:27.070
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:27.070 --> 44:34.494
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:35.498 --> 44:42.948
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
